  "title": "Mercantile Bank Corporation Announces Strong Second Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "Mercantile Bank Corporation (NASDAQ: MBWM) (\"Mercantile\") reported net income of $25.9 million, or $1.50 per diluted share, for the second quarter of 2026, compared with net income of $22.6 million, or $1.39 per diluted share, for the second quarter of 2025. Net income during the first six months of 2026 totaled $48.6 million, or $2.82 per diluted share, compared with net income of $42.2 million, or $2.60 per diluted share, during the first six months of 2025. Excluding non-recurring costs ass",
